Packaged browser speech runtime

runtime.js includes ONNX Runtime Web 1.30.0 (Microsoft, MIT),
Transformers.js 4.3.1 tokenizer utilities (Hugging Face, Apache-2.0),
Tokenizers.js 0.2.0 (Apache-2.0), Jinja 0.5.10 (MIT), and
phonemizer 1.2.1 (Xenova, Apache-2.0), which embeds eSpeak NG (GPL-3.0).
The English Kokoro phonemization helper is from Kokoro.js (Apache-2.0).
Their licenses accompany this distribution. Runtime JS and WASM are local files.

